1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:03,346
Somewhere in your business,
someone reads a document…

2
00:00:03,416 --> 00:00:05,301
then types it all out again.

3
00:00:05,655 --> 00:00:09,021
Invoices. Referrals. Applications.

4
00:00:09,041 --> 00:00:10,922
A different layout every time.

5
00:00:10,942 --> 00:00:12,864
The same hours, every week.

6
00:00:13,541 --> 00:00:15,084
That's language work.

7
00:00:15,104 --> 00:00:17,729
And it's exactly where AI earns its place.

8
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,554
We build AI that reads them,
pulls out what matters,

9
00:00:21,574 --> 00:00:23,246
and fills in your records.

10
00:00:23,296 --> 00:00:25,893
Anything it isn't sure
of goes to a person.

11
00:00:26,682 --> 00:00:29,363
It sorts your inbox by
what each message means,

12
00:00:29,383 --> 00:00:31,329
and passes it to the right desk.

13
00:00:32,136 --> 00:00:34,956
It drafts replies from the
records you already hold,

14
00:00:34,996 --> 00:00:37,204
and shows where every answer came from.

15
00:00:37,986 --> 00:00:41,961
And if the job doesn't need AI, we'll
tell you, and build the boring version.

16
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,248
It's cheaper, and it breaks less often.

17
00:00:44,977 --> 00:00:46,204
No retainer.

18
00:00:46,224 --> 00:00:47,952
A price before we start.

19
00:00:47,972 --> 00:00:49,642
You own what we build.

20
00:00:51,818 --> 00:00:53,019
n.abl

21
00:00:53,039 --> 00:00:55,045
AI, where it earns its place.
